Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.85,0:00:10.02,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（學期成績單 修業證明）
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.67,0:00:10.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.75,0:00:12.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,第一學期的成績還好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:17.52,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（特別活動表現 行為表現）
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.55,0:00:15.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,全部都是優等呢
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.90,0:00:17.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.72,0:00:19.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喔 真厲害耶
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.37,0:00:20.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣很厲害嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.62,0:00:22.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很厲害啊
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.32,0:00:24.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小華的成績呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.72,0:00:27.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,普通啦 普通
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.50,0:00:29.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你咧？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.37,0:00:32.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為我原本是國中生嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.50,0:00:35.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來 大家
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.30,0:00:38.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,明天開始放暑假
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.90,0:00:40.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然玩樂很重要
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.75,0:00:42.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但還有作業和幫忙家事
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.90,0:00:44.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大家別忘了喔
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.50,0:00:45.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.35,0:00:54.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大家是怎麼過暑假呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.82,0:00:56.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸和媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.75,0:01:00.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好像打算在放假期間改善系統
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.95,0:01:02.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是阿爾瑪的計畫啦
Dialogue: 2,0:01:02.47,0:01:03.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒有特別安排
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.75,0:01:06.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那我們一起去度假吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然很想這樣提議
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.75,0:01:11.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但我暑假必須去總公司露個臉
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.22,0:01:13.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還得工作才行
Dialogue: 2,0:01:14.15,0:01:15.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妮恩好忙喔
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.50,0:01:17.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小華的打算呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.95,0:01:20.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,夏季要和奶奶回鄉下老家
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.77,0:01:21.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 2,0:01:21.62,0:01:23.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,會在夏日祭典的時候回來的
Dialogue: 2,0:01:24.22,0:01:25.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,夏日祭典？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.45,0:01:26.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:31.92,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（夏日祭典 納涼 8月28日）
Dialogue: 2,0:01:26.65,0:01:28.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是蠻大的祭典喔
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.80,0:01:30.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還有煙火秀
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.77,0:01:31.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好棒啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:32.52,0:01:33.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪 小華
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.95,0:01:36.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大家一起去夏日祭典吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.32,0:01:37.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我要去
Dialogue: 2,0:01:39.20,0:01:40.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯 是可以啦
Dialogue: 2,0:01:42.85,0:01:43.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 2,0:01:43.57,0:01:44.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,祝你們休假愉快
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.80,0:01:45.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,掰掰
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.37,0:01:52.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,放暑假了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.07,0:02:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（阿爾瑪醬想成為家人）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.42,0:03:30.20,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（“暑假”）
Dialogue: 2,0:03:30.17,0:03:31.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好熱
Dialogue: 2,0:03:33.07,0:03:35.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,昨天沒什麼睡
Dialogue: 2,0:03:36.10,0:03:37.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,早點回家睡覺吧
Dialogue: 2,0:03:38.75,0:03:40.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 2,0:03:50.50,0:03:52.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這下… 完了…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:00.87,0:04:01.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:01.62,0:04:03.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我剛不是…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:03.62,0:04:05.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,覺得不舒服…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.77,0:04:07.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒事吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.57,0:04:10.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,清醒了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:13.72,0:04:14.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,感覺怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:16.12,0:04:17.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哇！抱歉！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:18.52,0:04:20.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不可以突然亂動喔
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.52,0:04:28.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 2,0:04:28.67,0:04:30.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我還沒習慣這副模樣
Dialogue: 2,0:04:30.82,0:04:32.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒能順利避開
Dialogue: 2,0:04:32.65,0:04:34.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊 沒關…
Dialogue: 2,0:04:35.97,0:04:37.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總之謝謝妳
Dialogue: 2,0:04:53.82,0:04:54.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:56.45,0:04:56.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒有？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:01.05,0:05:02.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,剛剛明明還在的啊
Dialogue: 2,0:05:02.80,0:05:03.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.25,0:05:07.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我家的鑰匙好像掉了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:08.37,0:05:09.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那可麻煩了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:10.47,0:05:12.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸會很晚才回家吧
Dialogue: 2,0:05:13.10,0:05:14.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,而且那把鑰匙是…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.80,0:05:16.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 2,0:05:18.07,0:05:19.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我也來幫你找
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.02,0:05:22.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不用啦
Dialogue: 2,0:05:22.67,0:05:24.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果情報屬實
Dialogue: 2,0:05:24.40,0:05:26.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很可能是在碰撞時掉的
Dialogue: 2,0:05:29.27,0:05:30.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我也有責任
Dialogue: 2,0:05:31.45,0:05:33.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總之先反推路線…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:37.55,0:05:40.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,形狀一致 鑰匙在那隻貓身上
Dialogue: 2,0:05:40.65,0:05:41.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,去追牠吧
Dialogue: 2,0:05:46.20,0:05:48.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真難調整平衡感
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.27,0:05:51.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請等等
Dialogue: 2,0:05:52.40,0:05:53.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-那人是在幹嘛\N-不用害怕喔
Dialogue: 2,0:05:54.52,0:05:55.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 2,0:06:07.62,0:06:09.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那隻貓跑哪去了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:18.47,0:06:19.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,追丟了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:21.77,0:06:25.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,平常的話應該能更輕鬆找到的…
Dialogue: 2,0:06:25.62,0:06:26.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沾到了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:29.10,0:06:29.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 2,0:06:33.62,0:06:35.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,去裡面找吧
Dialogue: 2,0:06:38.07,0:06:39.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,找不到啊
Dialogue: 2,0:06:41.97,0:06:44.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是高中生吧
Dialogue: 2,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒看到呢
Dialogue: 2,0:06:52.00,0:06:54.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,銀髮… 是外國人？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:59.25,0:07:00.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 2,0:07:02.32,0:07:04.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姊姊 這樣很危險喔
Dialogue: 2,0:07:04.67,0:07:05.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 2,0:07:07.10,0:07:08.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:08.22,0:07:09.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊 沒事
Dialogue: 2,0:07:09.90,0:07:12.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姊姊 妳表情沒什麼變化呢
Dialogue: 2,0:07:13.07,0:07:14.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,讓你覺得不舒服了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:14.35,0:07:16.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不 不是舒不舒服的問題
Dialogue: 2,0:07:17.62,0:07:19.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,該說覺得很可惜吧
Dialogue: 2,0:07:20.35,0:07:22.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果再多笑一點會更好吧
Dialogue: 2,0:07:23.75,0:07:25.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我是在說啥啊
Dialogue: 2,0:07:25.62,0:07:26.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:29.10,0:07:31.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哈哈哈！妳幹嘛啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:32.47,0:07:34.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是覺得害羞的笑
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.35,0:07:35.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哈哈哈！別這樣啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:35.82,0:07:36.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是…
Dialogue: 2,0:07:38.95,0:07:40.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,噗哈！喂！
Dialogue: 2,0:07:41.67,0:07:42.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真抱歉
Dialogue: 2,0:07:42.82,0:07:44.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們還在找貓呢
Dialogue: 2,0:07:45.10,0:07:46.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,從高的地方開始找吧
Dialogue: 2,0:07:52.50,0:07:53.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姊姊危險…
Dialogue: 2,0:08:12.07,0:08:14.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,唉 不可能這麼剛好就找到的
Dialogue: 2,0:08:14.67,0:08:15.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:16.37,0:08:17.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,在那邊
Dialogue: 2,0:08:58.95,0:09:00.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抓到貓了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:00.55,0:09:02.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太 太好了…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:03.62,0:09:05.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抱歉一直追著你跑
Dialogue: 2,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但這樣一來
Dialogue: 2,0:09:07.42,0:09:08.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呃 這個是
Dialogue: 2,0:09:08.65,0:09:10.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,穿線時用的
Dialogue: 2,0:09:14.77,0:09:15.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我太粗心了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:16.40,0:09:19.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,竟把穿針器誤認成鑰匙了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:20.07,0:09:22.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也叫做穿線器
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:23.87,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（穿針器 家政課縫紉工具之一）
Dialogue: 2,0:09:22.62,0:09:23.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是這樣稱呼的啊
Dialogue: 2,0:09:34.20,0:09:36.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,跑了好遠
Dialogue: 2,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,快要天黑了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:52.42,0:09:53.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果變暗
Dialogue: 2,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就很難找到鑰匙了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:56.52,0:09:57.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 2,0:09:57.67,0:09:59.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,都怪我能力不足
Dialogue: 2,0:10:00.27,0:10:02.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒辦法嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:10:02.67,0:10:05.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,反正晚上我爸就回來了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:15.65,0:10:17.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請先不要動
Dialogue: 2,0:10:35.67,0:10:36.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:38.07,0:10:40.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這就是你在找的東西吧
Dialogue: 2,0:10:41.65,0:10:43.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,卡在衣服的帽子上了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:43.82,0:10:46.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗄？搞什麼嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:10:50.85,0:10:52.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,竟然有這種事
Dialogue: 2,0:10:53.20,0:10:54.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,直樹？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:55.87,0:10:57.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯 是我的名字
Dialogue: 2,0:10:58.27,0:10:58.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這個…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:59.70,0:11:02.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是我小時候去世的母親給我的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:03.32,0:11:04.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,刻了名字
Dialogue: 2,0:11:04.85,0:11:06.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,感覺幼稚又老土
Dialogue: 2,0:11:08.42,0:11:09.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是如果弄丟了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:10.15,0:11:11.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,會覺得對不起她
Dialogue: 2,0:11:14.65,0:11:15.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,幸好找到了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:16.12,0:11:17.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對直樹而言
Dialogue: 2,0:11:17.42,0:11:18.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是很重要的東西
Dialogue: 2,0:11:19.60,0:11:21.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就說了沒那麼誇張啦…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:22.15,0:11:22.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 2,0:11:25.25,0:11:27.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真的… 太好了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:39.47,0:11:40.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 2,0:11:44.27,0:11:45.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:46.10,0:11:47.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:48.27,0:11:49.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就是說…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:49.52,0:11:50.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 2,0:11:52.92,0:11:53.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姊姊
Dialogue: 2,0:11:54.57,0:11:55.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳的…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:56.72,0:11:57.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒什麼！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:09.95,0:12:13.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,姊姊的名字…
Dialogue: 2,0:12:35.60,0:12:38.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,後來再也沒見過她
Dialogue: 2,0:12:39.87,0:12:41.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,查了一下 那套制服
Dialogue: 2,0:12:41.85,0:12:43.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好幾年前就已經廢除
Dialogue: 2,0:12:44.15,0:12:45.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好像沒在使用了
Dialogue: 2,0:12:47.15,0:12:50.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,難道是幻覺嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:12:51.90,0:12:53.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪！
Dialogue: 2,0:12:53.40,0:12:53.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來了！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:10.42,0:13:11.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎麼啦？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:12.32,0:13:14.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,錯覺嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:23.35,0:13:26.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,畫圖日記… 是暑假作業嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:13:26.32,0:13:26.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 2,0:13:29.57,0:13:31.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,習題本太過簡單
Dialogue: 2,0:13:31.62,0:13:33.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,拿到當天就寫完了
Dialogue: 2,0:13:35.47,0:13:39.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,結果是自由研究或日記最麻煩呢
Dialogue: 2,0:13:40.20,0:13:42.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我看看妳寫了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.50,0:13:46.45,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（8月26日 沒有特別的事 維持電量\N8月27日 沒有特別的事 維持電量）
Dialogue: 2,0:13:43.87,0:13:45.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有10天都是相同的內容
Dialogue: 2,0:13:46.87,0:13:48.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一起玩吧 一起玩吧
Dialogue: 2,0:13:49.15,0:13:51.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,今年夏天因為很忙
Dialogue: 2,0:13:51.75,0:13:54.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,的確沒怎麼陪伴阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:13:55.05,0:13:56.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿… 阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:13:56.50,0:13:58.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,暑假還剩幾天？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:58.57,0:13:59.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,剩4天
Dialogue: 2,0:13:59.85,0:14:00.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是喔
Dialogue: 2,0:14:01.80,0:14:05.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好 這4天只要時間許可
Dialogue: 2,0:14:05.17,0:14:06.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就帶妳去妳喜歡的地方
Dialogue: 2,0:14:07.15,0:14:08.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,媽媽也一起嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:08.45,0:14:09.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,當然一起啊
Dialogue: 2,0:14:10.32,0:14:11.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 2,0:14:11.85,0:14:13.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我來安排行程！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:13.77,0:14:14.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,隨妳安排！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:20.47,0:14:22.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只要嚴格安排行程
Dialogue: 2,0:14:22.65,0:14:24.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就能發揮最大效率
Dialogue: 2,0:14:25.35,0:14:28.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可以排很多行程
Dialogue: 2,0:14:31.65,0:14:33.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,香蕉算是點心嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:44.60,0:14:46.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸 媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:14:46.90,0:14:49.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好啦… 我知道啦
Dialogue: 2,0:14:50.97,0:14:53.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,收音機體操第一套
Dialogue: 2,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一二三四
Dialogue: 2,0:14:57.62,0:15:00.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,五六七八
Dialogue: 2,0:15:00.42,0:15:02.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一二三四
Dialogue: 2,0:15:03.10,0:15:06.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-對室內派來說早晨活動真痛苦啊\N-五六七八
Dialogue: 2,0:15:06.70,0:15:08.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,早晨陽光好刺眼
Dialogue: 2,0:15:11.82,0:15:13.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,祝大家今日順利
Dialogue: 2,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,去睡回籠覺吧
Dialogue: 2,0:15:17.80,0:15:18.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請稍等
Dialogue: 2,0:15:19.22,0:15:21.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,稍後6點32分
Dialogue: 2,0:15:21.97,0:15:23.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要去其他地方
Dialogue: 2,0:15:23.32,0:15:24.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,去哪？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:25.82,0:15:29.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,今天接下來要完成七項暑假行程
Dialogue: 2,0:15:30.55,0:15:33.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,13點18分抵達海邊
Dialogue: 2,0:15:33.60,0:15:36.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,潛水和觀光之類的都已經預約了！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:40.32,0:15:40.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 2,0:15:41.52,0:15:42.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 2,0:15:43.00,0:15:45.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,至少讓我們換衣服
Dialogue: 2,0:15:45.82,0:15:47.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,常常 我們也走吧
Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.02,0:15:48.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我要睡覺
Dialogue: 2,0:15:49.87,0:15:51.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,前往夏威夷
Dialogue: 2,0:15:51.45,0:15:53.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,約需一小時四十六分鐘
Dialogue: 2,0:15:58.77,0:15:59.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大海！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:03.35,0:16:05.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝謝妳出借海灘
Dialogue: 2,0:16:06.37,0:16:08.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為了阿爾瑪 這不算什麼！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:10.02,0:16:11.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為啥是外國啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:12.57,0:16:14.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一抵達夏威夷
Dialogue: 2,0:16:14.22,0:16:15.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,由於時差的關係
Dialogue: 2,0:16:15.70,0:16:17.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,能立刻享受假期的午間時光
Dialogue: 2,0:16:19.32,0:16:20.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這… 這樣啊
Dialogue: 2,0:16:21.17,0:16:23.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但來海邊就得穿泳衣…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:23.62,0:16:24.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那我該做什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:25.22,0:16:27.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,上次來還是國中… 小學的時候？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:28.72,0:16:30.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你那什麼表情
Dialogue: 2,0:16:30.45,0:16:32.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,反正你一定在想這不適合我
Dialogue: 2,0:16:33.85,0:16:34.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 2,0:16:35.37,0:16:37.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我 我又沒有那樣…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:40.60,0:16:42.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎 怎樣啦
Dialogue: 2,0:16:42.65,0:16:45.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸 媽媽 快來！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:46.77,0:16:48.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪妳等等！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:48.30,0:16:49.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好耶！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:49.57,0:16:50.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我潑我潑我潑
Dialogue: 2,0:16:51.07,0:16:52.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我不會輸的
Dialogue: 2,0:17:03.50,0:17:06.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,該進行下個行程了
Dialogue: 2,0:17:09.65,0:17:11.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,土產已經買好了
Dialogue: 2,0:17:15.65,0:17:16.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,輪到我了
Dialogue: 2,0:17:18.30,0:17:19.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是我的
Dialogue: 2,0:17:20.37,0:17:21.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,交給我吧
Dialogue: 2,0:17:22.37,0:17:23.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,接到了
Dialogue: 2,0:17:23.45,0:17:24.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,做得好
Dialogue: 2,0:17:24.92,0:17:26.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,晚上要幹嘛？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:26.60,0:17:29.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,海濱公園好像有祭典
Dialogue: 2,0:17:29.67,0:17:30.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:30.57,0:17:32.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,刨冰 棉花糖
Dialogue: 2,0:17:32.32,0:17:34.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,法蘭克福香腸 撈金魚
Dialogue: 2,0:17:34.87,0:17:37.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,價格明顯比成本高出許多的
Dialogue: 2,0:17:37.05,0:17:39.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,各種食品和遊樂設施
Dialogue: 2,0:17:39.55,0:17:41.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然莫名其妙 但又讓我很感興趣！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:46.07,0:17:50.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,快速增強的颱風18號娜娜泰爾
Dialogue: 2,0:17:50.75,0:17:52.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,正以驚人的速度北上往本州前進…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:53.92,0:17:55.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,祭典可能會取消吧
Dialogue: 2,0:17:56.07,0:17:57.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然可惜
Dialogue: 2,0:17:57.67,0:17:59.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但天氣這種事也沒辦法
Dialogue: 2,0:18:00.72,0:18:03.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,總不可能消滅颱風吧
Dialogue: 2,0:18:04.92,0:18:06.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好吧 別太沮喪
Dialogue: 2,0:18:07.00,0:18:09.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對呀 明年也可以…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:10.02,0:18:11.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一起玩吧
Dialogue: 2,0:18:12.22,0:18:14.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啟動緊急發射系統
Dialogue: 2,0:18:19.60,0:18:21.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,反應器驅動同步
Dialogue: 2,0:18:23.72,0:18:25.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,解除所有限制
Dialogue: 2,0:18:26.37,0:18:27.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,極限陣型
Dialogue: 2,0:18:28.95,0:18:30.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,最大輸出
Dialogue: 2,0:18:31.42,0:18:33.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,超級阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:18:33.82,0:18:35.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,光束
Dialogue: 2,0:18:44.65,0:18:45.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,快訊！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:45.85,0:18:47.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,颱風突然消滅了！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:50.82,0:18:52.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,根本沒想到她會真的去做
Dialogue: 2,0:18:53.32,0:18:54.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很棒的光束呢！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:03.77,0:19:05.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-不愧是阿爾瑪小姐！\N-不愧是阿爾瑪！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:05.80,0:19:07.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,浴衣也很適合妳呢
Dialogue: 2,0:19:07.82,0:19:09.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大家的浴衣都很可愛
Dialogue: 2,0:19:09.82,0:19:11.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,人太多了吧
Dialogue: 2,0:19:11.60,0:19:13.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,熱鬧一點很好呀
Dialogue: 2,0:19:14.85,0:19:16.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,走囉！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:16.45,0:19:18.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來比比誰的射擊更厲害吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:18.90,0:19:19.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,瑪琪娜！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:19.62,0:19:21.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,也來玩這裡的撈球吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:21.40,0:19:22.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:22.30,0:19:23.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,等一下等一下
Dialogue: 2,0:19:23.85,0:19:24.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳們聽好了
Dialogue: 2,0:19:25.27,0:19:27.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只能在我的視線範圍內活動
Dialogue: 2,0:19:27.60,0:19:28.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,知道了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:28.47,0:19:29.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 2,0:19:29.67,0:19:30.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,根本沒聽進去吧
Dialogue: 2,0:19:30.70,0:19:31.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:31.67,0:19:32.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:34.82,0:19:35.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 2,0:19:36.17,0:19:37.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,撈球是什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:38.15,0:19:39.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,撈金魚的小球版本
Dialogue: 2,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看來還是不懂啊
Dialogue: 2,0:19:43.95,0:19:45.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,跟我來 親眼看比較快
Dialogue: 2,0:19:45.97,0:19:48.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我想玩那個還有跳盆舞藝
Dialogue: 2,0:19:48.90,0:19:49.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是盆舞
Dialogue: 2,0:19:50.90,0:19:52.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小常也來吧
Dialogue: 2,0:19:52.62,0:19:53.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗄？小常？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:53.82,0:19:55.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我好歹比妳大欸！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:56.25,0:19:57.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 2,0:20:00.42,0:20:03.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真的變得很熱鬧呢
Dialogue: 2,0:20:09.57,0:20:10.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 2,0:20:45.72,0:20:47.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是煙火！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:14.35,0:21:16.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是累死人的行程
Dialogue: 2,0:21:16.82,0:21:20.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,下次得更加仔細規畫才行
Dialogue: 2,0:21:23.65,0:21:26.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不過… 這種的也不錯
Dialogue: 2,0:21:27.05,0:21:29.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,畢竟從她還小的時候\N就一直在開發或研究
Dialogue: 2,0:21:30.17,0:21:32.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,整天都待在家裡呢
Dialogue: 2,0:21:33.12,0:21:34.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對了 阿爾瑪呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:21:35.22,0:21:36.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,她應該在房間…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.10,0:22:04.87,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（今天的阿爾瑪報告）
Dialogue: 2,0:22:00.80,0:22:02.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪的暑假是甲上
Dialogue: 2,0:22:05.70,0:22:06.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,過得很開心呢
